    "result_text": "All 263 tests pass. \n\nI implemented the customerCode de-duplication in `OwnerRestControllerV1.java`:\n\n- At the create-owner call site (line ~205), the freshly computed code now flows through a new `deduplicatedCustomerCode(...)` helper before being assigned.\n- The helper collects every existing owner's `customerCode`, returns the base unchanged when it's free, and otherwise appends `-<n>` starting at `n=2` and incrementing to the smallest value that isn't already taken.\n- Added the `java.util.HashSet` import (`Set` was already imported).\n\nThe existing `coreCustomerCodesStayUnique` acceptance test and the full suite are green.",
